	(text "POWER / SOFTWARE ARM  (4 x AA holder -> reverse-block P-FET -> PPTC -> slide switch ON/OFF -> VSYS ; D51 + hold-up -> LDO 3V3 ; ARM = high-side P-FET VSYS->VFIRE (rail dead when disarmed))"
