	(text "U9 LP38692MP-3.3: VSYS -> D51 -> VLDO (C67+C68 2x470 uF hold-up) -> 3V3 (feeds the SuperMini 3V3 pin; its 5V pin is open)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 355.6 86.36 0)
