	)
	(text "TWO independent barriers: FW_ARM (GPIO20) -> Q25 -> Q27 rail; FW_OE (GPIO4) -> Q26 -> 595 outputs. Each has its own 2.2k pulldown: one open resistor or one short opens only ONE barrier. Arm edge slowed by R187 1k + C70 10nF (Miller)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.56 199.39 0)
