	(text "CHANNEL  x24  -  CH0...CH23   (one identical block per channel: 3.5 mm jack + plug-detect 100k + low-side N-FET + gate series 150R + gate pulldown 100k + continuity tap 47k + RGB LED with DIN->DOUT bypass + ESD TVS)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 337.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "10ba8cc4-277e-563f-a892-f4065092ba02")
	)
	(text "x24 - CH0...CH23.  Fire: VFIRE (sleeve + R1, ARM-gated) -> e-match -> CHn (tip = FET drain) -> FET -> GND.  Gate: SRGATEn -150R-> GATEn -> FET gate (100k pulldown).  Continuity: CHn -47k-> MUXINn -> CD4051; plug detect: R2 -100k-> CHn.  RGB chain DIN->DOUT (bypass JPn for unpopulated channels).  ESD TVS (ESD5Z12-AQ) CHn->GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 347.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
