	(text "RGB_DATA (GPIO10) -> SN74LV1T125 -> RGB_5V -> D49 -> D50 -> RGB_IN -> CH0 -> ... -> CH23 (DOUT open). VDD = V5_LED (5 V LDO from VSYS, see below): the 5 V WS2812B (VIH 0.7*VDD) stays inside its datasheet range over the whole battery range. 1x 100nF per 2 LEDs, placed at the LEDs."
